g\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eShips in 3-5 Business Days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoftness Index:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eSuper Soft\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 12px;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eNOTE: The \"Collage Border\" area of any quick collage layout must be filled with a background color or pattern fill of some kind and cannot be left empty. Please do not place text or photos in the \"Collage Border\" area.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"description\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWatch a Video to see how Design tool Works\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40521830339,"sku":"30x60TWL-BEACH-CLG","price":34.95,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-towels-photo-quick-collage-beach-towel-30-x-60-1.jpg?v=1506962624"},{"product_id":"photo-ribbed-kitchen-towel-18-x-35","title":"Photo Ribbed Kitchen Towel - 18\" x 35\"","description":"Reproduce your photos in the style of a stunning 18\" x 35\" ribbed textured kitchen towel. Your layout is dyed in stunning clarity onto this absorbent addition to your kitchen.\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e 18\" x 35\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Microfiber Polyester\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ships in 3-5 Business Days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoftness Index:\u003c\/strong\u003e Super Soft\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTexture:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ribbed\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSet it up with a single image or a collage!\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/XsiD6iI4HmY\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/iframe\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41066546371,"sku":"18x35TWL-KTCHN","price":21.95,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-towels-mother-s-day-gifts-photo-ribbed-kitchen-towel-18-x-35-1.jpg?v=1506962715"},{"product_id":"60-round-photo-beach-towel","title":"60\" Round Photo Beach Towel","description":"This soft and absorbent polyester and cotton loop terry beach towel reverses to an ultra-smooth microfiber side that's optimized for full color photos. Whether you're lounging by the pool, headed to the beach and more, this towel is a great way to relax while making a personal statement.\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e 60\" Diameter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e 75% Polyester, 25% Cotton; Micro Fiber Towel fabric front, Cotton terrycloth back\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ships in 3-5 Business Days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoftness Index:\u003c\/strong\u003e Super Soft\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSet it up with a single image or a collage!\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/XsiD6iI4HmY\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/iframe\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":37948316355,"sku":"60TWL-CIRCULAR-09","price":59.95,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-towels-mother-s-day-gifts-valentine-s-day-gifts-60-round-photo-beach-towel-1.jpg?v=1500068595"},{"product_id":"35-x-60-heavyweight-terry-velour-photo-collage-beach-towel","title":"35\" x 60\" Heavyweight Terry-Velour Quick Collage Beach Towel - 8 Image Template","description":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan\u003eGo with upscale, soft and luxurious with our Heavyweight Terry-Velour Beach Towel – thicker and heavier than our regular 30\" x 60\" beach towels! A perfect gift for the spring and summer months.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e  This option allows you to quickly and easily set up an 8 image collage using our template and your images!\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e35\" x 60\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e75% Polyester, 25% Cotton\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eDye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eShips in 3-5 Business Days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoftness Index:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eSuper Soft\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTexture:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003ePoly-velour front, high-end plush cotton backing\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 12px;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eThe \"Collage Border\" area of any quick collage layout must be filled with a background color or pattern fill of some kind and cannot be left empty. Please do not place text or photos in the \"Collage Border\" area.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"description\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWatch a Video to see how Design tool Works\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41630549955,"sku":"35x60TWL-HVYBCH-CLG","price":54.95,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-towels-35-x-60-heavyweight-terry-velour-photo-quick-collage-beach-towel-1.jpg?v=1501186931"},{"product_id":"personalized-photo-fleece-scarf","title":"Personalized Photo Fleece Scarf","description":"\u003cp\u003ePersonalized winter Scarf, made from soft Fleece, 61\" x 8\". Turn your photos into a winter fashion statement!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"feat-name\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial: \u003c\/strong\u003e100% Polyester Polar Fleece\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"feat-name\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dye Sublimation\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"feat-name\"