cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e75% Polyester, 25% Cotton\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eDye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eShips in 3-5 Business Days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoftness Index:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eSuper Soft\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTexture:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003ePoly-velour front, high-end plush cotton backing\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSet it up with a single image or a collage!\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/XsiD6iI4HmY\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"\u003e\u003c\/iframe\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"PersonalThrows","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41499091395,"sku":"60x72TWL","price":99.95,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/60-x-72-two-person-terry-velour-photo-beach-towel-1.jpg?v=1500068772"},{"product_id":"60-round-quick-collage-beach-towel","title":"60\" Round Quick Collage Beach Towel -9 Image Template","description":"This soft and absorbent polyester and cotton loop terry beach towel reverses to an ultra-smooth microfiber side that's optimized for full color photos. Whether you're lounging by the pool, headed to the beach and more, this towel is a great way to relax while making a personal statement. This option allows for you to quickly and easily set up a 9 image collage using our template and your images!\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e 60\" Diameter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e 75% Polyester, 25% Cotton; Micro Fiber Towel fabric front, Cotton terrycloth back\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ships in 3-5 Business Days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoftness Index:\u003c\/strong\u003e Super Soft\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 12px;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eNOTE: The \"Collage Border\" area of any quick collage layout must be filled with a background color or pattern fill of some kind and cannot be left empty. Please do not place text or photos in the \"Collage Border\" area.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"description\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWatch a Video to see how Design tool Works\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42303463619,"sku":"60TWL-CIRCULAR","price":59.95,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-towels-60-round-quick-collage-beach-towel-1.jpg?v=1501187386"},{"product_id":"60-x-72-two-person-terry-velour-quick-collage-beach-towel","title":"60\" x 72\" Two-Person Terry-Velour Quick Collage Beach Towel -12 Image Template","description":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eOur largest beach towel yet, perfect for couples! A perfect gift for the spring and summer months.  This option allows you to quickly and easily set up a 12 image collage using our template and your images!\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 60\u003c\/span\u003e\" x 72\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e75% Polyester, 25% Cotton\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eDye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eShips in 3-5 Business Days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoftness Index:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eSuper Soft\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTexture:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003ePoly-velour front, high-end plush cotton backing\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 12px;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eNOTE: The \"Collage Border\" area of any quick collage layout must be filled with a background color or pattern fill of some kind and cannot be left empty. Please do not place text or photos in the \"Collage Border\" area.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"PersonalThrows","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42577178371,"sku":"60x72TWL","price":99.95,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/60-x-72-two-person-terry-velour-quick-collage-beach-towel-1.jpg?v=1501187927"},{"product_id":"8-x-21-photo-christmas-stocking","title":"8\" x 21\" Photo Christmas Stocking","description":"\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eBack again for the Holiday Season; the Photo Christmas Stocking!\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e8\" x 21\", and comes ready to hang. Our talented designers have created a high quality design in the spirit of the holidays to frame your photo before it's printed onto the stocking.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e 100% Polyester, Coarse Weave Poly-Duck Fabric\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ships out in 4 to 6 Business Days after final proof approval.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cem\u003eProofing included.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43842179395,"sku":"8x21STOCKING-HS19","price":34.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/holiday-gifts-8-x-21-photo-christmas-stocking-1.jpg?v=1501185563"},{"product_id":"17-photo-christmas-stocking","title":"17\" Photo Christmas Stocking","description":"\u003cstrong\u003eWe had them last year, and they're back! Photo Christmas Stockings!\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eOur talented designers have created a high quality design to frame your photo before it's printed onto the stocking. This product is available in two different fabrics:\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCoarse Weave Fabric\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eA 100% polyester fabric with a visible weave. Its texture is comparable to canvas. Stockings made from this fabric come without a lining.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFleece Fabric\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eThis fabric is much like the fleece our Polar Fleece Blankets are made from; it is soft and smooth to the touch. Stockings made from this fabric come with a lining, available in the following colors:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhite\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003eRed\u003c\/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong\u003eGreen\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ships out in 4 to 6 Business Days after final proof approval.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cem\u003eProofing included.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Coarse Weave (No Lining)","offer_id":37758104707,"sku":"17STOCKING-PlyCnvs","price":23.74,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Fleece \/w White Lining","offer_id":43842032259,"sku":"17STOCKING-WhtLng","price":24.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Fleece \/w Red Lining","offer_id":43842032323,"sku":"17STOCKING-RedLng","price":24.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Fleece \/w Green Lining","offer_id":43842032387,"sku":"17STOCKING-GrnLng","price":24.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/holiday-gifts-17-photo-christmas-stocking-1.jpg?v=1501185556"},{"product_id":"copy-of-photo-golf-towel-15x22","title":"Copy of Photo Golf Towel - 15\"x22\"","description":"\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 15\" x 22\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaterial: Micro-Polyester\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eProduction Process: Dye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrewashed\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDoes not shrink\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eProduction Time: Ships in 3-5 Business Days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSoftness Index: Super Soft\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src